          "The shot-level action is an overview, not an extra timeline segment. Distribute every concrete physical beat to exactly one correct segment and execute it once: never perform a later speaker's pickup or display in the opening segment, never retrieve the same object twice, and never replay a completed action in the final hold. Each segment stateBefore must equal the previous segment stateAfter, and the final segment stateAfter must equal the shot's single stateAfter and all dialogue-body outcomes.",
